      "text": "Another quarter, another @MessariCrypto report reminding me I picked the right chain.  💜\n\nEverything about this one screams progress for $POL holders.\n\nHere are the key takeaways:\n🔹 POL market cap up 39.2% QoQ to $2.36B\n🔹PoS DeFi TVL reached $1.14B, led by Polymarket (+29%) and QuickSwap (+15%)\n🔹 Stablecoin supply grew 22% QoQ to $2.94B led by USDT (+35%)\n🔹 Payments apps processed $1.82B across 50+ platforms (+49%)\n🔹 Bhilai, Heimdall v2, and Rio upgrades pushing PoS toward 5,000 TPS\n\n@Polymarket keeps proving itself as one of the most active dApps in crypto, now fully compliant to serve U.S. users again after acquiring QCEX.\n\nRWAs are on fire too, with issuances from numerous banks as well as the Philippines DBM pushing Polygon past $1B in tokenized assets.\n\nWith Agglayer expanding and new chains coming online, Polygon's ecosystem is only getting denser. I think $POL holders are sitting right where the action's headed.",
